          "_name": "features038",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features38\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\" checked>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Image</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Height\" name=\"imageHeight\" min=\"3\" max=\"6\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"autoSize\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>📢 DRAMATIC VOICE-OVER🎭</b></h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">(നാടകീയ ശബ്ദാവിഷ്കാരം)\n<br>DRAMATIC VOICE-OVER • നാടകീയ ശബ്ദാവിഷ്കാരം • नाटकीय वॉयस-ओवर\n<br>സ്വന്തം ശബ്ദത്തിലൂടെ വരികൾക്ക് അതീവ നാടകീയതയോ ഭാവങ്ങളോ നൽകി മികച്ച വോയ്‌സ് റെക്കോർഡിംഗ് വീഡിയോകൾ ചെയ്യുക.\n<br>Giving high emotional depth and dramatic expressions to the lyrics using your own voice-over creativity.\n<br> अपनी खुद की आवाज के माध्यम से गीत के बोलों को गहरी भावनात्मक अभिव्यक्ति और नाटकीयता देना।<br><br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-lcmtqolcmtqolcmt-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row row-reverse justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>&nbsp; ⚡ FLASH MOB </b><br><b>(ഫ്ലാഷ് മോബ്)🎭</b></h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">FLASH MOB • ഫ്ലാഷ് മോബ് • फ्लैश मॉब\n<br>പെട്ടെന്ന് ഒരു കൂട്ടം ആളുകൾ ഒന്നിച്ച് വന്ന് വരികൾക്കൊപ്പം തീയേറ്ററിക്കൽ അല്ലെങ്കിൽ സിനിമാറ്റിക് ചുവടുകൾ വെക്കുന്ന ഗ്രൂപ്പ് പ്രകടനം.\n<br> A high-energy group performance where a crowd suddenly synchronizes with the song's beats using dynamic steps.\n<br> एक ऊर्जावान समूह प्रस्तुति जहां लोगों की भीड़ अचानक गाने की बीट्स पर तालमेल बिठाकर थिरकने लगती है।&nbsp;<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-ne1zslne1zslne1z-1-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>💋 DRAMATIC LIP SYNC </b><b>🎤&nbsp;</b></h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">DRAMATIC LIP SYNC • നാടകീയ ലിപ് സിങ്ക് • नाटकीय लिप सिंक\n<br>പാട്ടിലെ വരികൾക്ക് കൃത്യമായി ചുണ്ടുകൾ ചലിപ്പിക്കുന്നതിനൊപ്പം (Lip Sync) മുഖത്ത് മികച്ച അഭിനയ മുഹൂർത്തങ്ങൾ കൊണ്ടുവരിക.\n<br> Matching the lip movements perfectly with the song's vocals while delivering powerful facial expressions and acting.\n<br> शक्तिशाली चेहरे के भाव और अभिनय का प्रदर्शन करते हुए गीत के स्वर के साथ होंठों की हलचल (लिप-सिंक) का सटीक मिलान करना।&nbsp;<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-h6ttjlh6ttjlh6tt-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "features038-6r",
          "_cid": "vm9XjPkQRm",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".row-reverse": {
              "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
            },
            "& when (@reverseContent)": {
              ".row": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              },
              ".row-reverse": {
                "flex-direction": "row"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".image-wrapper": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "align-items": "center",
              "padding-top": "2rem",
              "padding-bottom": "2rem"
            },
            ".image-wrapper": {
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".text-wrapper": {
              "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 2rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            "img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "& when (@autoSize)": {
                "object-fit": "cover",
                "height": "(@imageHeight * 10rem)",
                "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 5rem)"
                }
              },
              "& when not (@autoSize)": {
                "height": "100%"
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "features038",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features38\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Image</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Height\" name=\"imageHeight\" min=\"3\" max=\"6\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"autoSize\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>&nbsp;🤫 POETIC MIME 🎭</b></h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">POETIC MIME • കാവ്യാത്മക മൂകാഭിനയം • काव्यात्मक मूक अभिनय\n<br>ശബ്ദമില്ലാതെ, മുഖഭാവങ്ങളിലൂടെയും ശരീരഭാഷയിലൂടെയും മാത്രം കവിതയുടെ ആഴമേറിയ അർത്ഥം പ്രേക്ഷകരിലേക്ക് എത്തിക്കുക.\n<br>Expressing the deep poetic meaning of the song through body language, gestures, and facial expressions without speaking.\n<br>बिना कुछ बोले, केवल शारीरिक भाषा, इशारों और चेहरे के भावों के माध्यम से गीत के गहरे काव्यात्मक अर्थ को व्यक्त करना।<br><br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/image201-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row row-reverse justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>&nbsp; &nbsp;🥁 FOLK SONG PERFORMANCE</b><b>🎭</b></h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">(നാടൻപാട്ട് ആവിഷ്കാരം)\n<br>FOLK SONG • നാടൻപാട്ട് • लोक गीत (Lok Geet)\n<br>(Gj കവിതകളെ നാടൻപാട്ടിന്റെ ഈണത്തിലും താളത്തിലും മാറ്റി പാടിക്കൊണ്ടുള്ള റീൽസുകൾ)\n<br>കവിതയുടെ വരികളെ നമ്മുടെ നാടൻപാട്ടുകളുടെ തനത് ഈണത്തിലും നാടൻ താളവാദ്യങ്ങളുടെ അകമ്പടിയോടെയും പുനരാവിഷ്കരിക്കുക.\n<br>Reimagining the poetic lyrics into a traditional rustic style, backed by folk rhythms and elements.\n<br> पारंपरिक लोक लय और तत्वों के सहयोग से काव्यात्मक बोलों को एक पारंपरिक देसी शैली में ढालना।<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-u2iqg7u2iqg7u2iq-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>🎭 TRADITIONAL THEATER / STREET PLAY&nbsp;</b><b>🎤&nbsp;</b></h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">(തെരുവ് നാടകം / നാടൻ നാടകം)\n<br>STREET PLAY / FOLK DRAMA • തെരുവുനാടകം / നാടൻ നാടകം • नुक्कड़ नाटक (Nukkad Natak)\n<br>(കവിതയിലെ സാമൂഹിക പ്രമേയങ്ങളെ മുൻനിർത്തി ചെയ്യാൻ പറ്റിയ ഒറ്റയാൾ നാടകങ്ങളോ തെരുവ് നാടക രൂപങ്ങളോ)\n<br>കവിതയിലെ സാമൂഹിക പ്രമേയങ്ങളെ മുൻനിർത്തി തെരുവ് നാടക ശൈലിയിലുള്ള തീക്ഷ്ണമായ അഭിനയ പ്രകടനം.\n<br>A raw, high-impact street-play style theatrical performance addressing the social messages in the lyrics.\n<br>गीत के सामाजिक संदेशों को उजागर करने वाली नुक्कड़-नाटक शैली की एक दमदार और प्रभावशाली प्रस्तुति।&nbsp;<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-cf40atcf40atcf40-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "features038-6s",
          "_cid": "vm9Y9fz0DL",
