          "_name": "features05",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features5\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <header>Card</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Icons\" name=\"showIcon\" checked>\n\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#2e481a\" selected condition=\"showIcon\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon BG\" name=\"iconbg\" value=\"#9fe870\" selected condition=\"showIcon\">\n    <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n      <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n      <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n      <option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n      <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n    </select>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#faf9cf\" selected>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-46sgd646sgd646sg-1408x768.png\" parallax selected>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#2e481a\">\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>ഷോർട്സ് &amp; റീൽസ് മത്സരം&nbsp;</b></h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\"></h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-idea mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><b>Gj Kavitha Samaharam</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">\n              Shorts &amp; Reels Competition: We are planning a special Shorts/Reels competition (iWizNet Channel Video Competition) for participants of our music streaming. Those who create the best Shorts &amp; Reels using our songs will have a chance to win exciting prizes. Interested participants, please register. Further details will be announced soon.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-growing-chart mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><b>Gj कविता संग्रह</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">\n              शॉर्ट्स और रील्स प्रतियोगिता: हम अपने म्यूजिक स्ट्रीमिंग के प्रतिभागियों के लिए एक विशेष शॉर्ट्स/रील्स प्रतियोगिता (iWizNet चैनल वीडियो प्रतियोगिता) की योजना बना रहे हैं। हमारे गानों का उपयोग करके सर्वश्रेष्ठ शॉर्ट्स और रील्स बनाने वालों के पास आकर्षक पुरस्कार जीतने का मौका होगा। इच्छुक प्रतिभागी कृपया पंजीकरण करें। अधिक जानकारी जल्द ही घोषित की जाएगी।\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-change-style mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><b>Gj കവിതാസമാഹാരം&nbsp;</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">ഷോർട്സ് &amp; റീൽസ് മത്സരം (Shorts &amp; Reels Competition): നമ്മുടെ മ്യൂസിക് സ്ട്രീമിങ്ങിൽ പങ്കെടുക്കുന്നവർക്കായി ഒരു പ്രത്യേക ഷോർട്സ് / റീൽസ് മത്സരം (iWizNet Channel വീഡിയോ മത്സരം) ഞങ്ങൾ പ്ലാൻ ചെയ്യുന്നുണ്ട്. നമ്മുടെ പാട്ടുകൾ ഉപയോഗിച്ച് മികച്ച ഷോർട്സ് &amp; റീൽസ് ചെയ്യുന്നവർക്ക് ആകർഷകമായ സമ്മാനങ്ങൾ നേടാനുള്ള അവസരമുണ്ടായിരിക്കും. പങ്കെടുക്കാൻ താല്പര്യപ്പെടുന്നവർ രജിസ്റ്റർ ചെയ്യുക. ഇതിന്റെ കൂടുതൽ വിവരങ്ങൾ ഉടൻ തന്നെ അറിയിക്കുന്നതാണ്.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n              <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
