          "_name": "header15",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header15\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"12\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"12\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Width\" name=\"cardWidth\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"12\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n\n\t\t<header>Card Background</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" name=\"wrapBgImage\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@THEME_PATH@/components/header15/../_images/background1.jpg\">\n\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#bcef9b\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"card col-12 col-lg-{{cardWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-wrapper wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>\"iFAi\"&nbsp; &nbsp;Welcome!&nbsp; Join our community</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b><i>ഞങ്ങളുടെ കമ്മ്യൂണിറ്റിയിലേക്ക് നിങ്ങളെ സ്വാഗതം ചെയ്യുന്നു. </i></b><br>സ്ട്രീറ്റ് മ്യൂസിക്കിലൂടെയും മോട്ടിവേഷണൽ യാത്രകളിലൂടെയും മാറ്റങ്ങൾ കൊണ്ടുവരാൻ ആഗ്രഹിക്കുന്നവർക്കായിട്ടാണ് ഈ കൂട്ടായ്മ രൂപീകരിച്ചിരിക്കുന്നത്.<br><br>ഞങ്ങളുടെ കമ്മ്യൂണിറ്റിയുടെ ഭാഗമാകുന്നതിലൂടെ താഴെ പറയുന്ന ലക്ഷ്യങ്ങളിൽ നിങ്ങൾക്ക് പങ്കുചേരാം:<br><br><b><i>സ്ട്രീറ്റ് മ്യൂസിക് റൈഡ്: </i></b><br>തെരുവുകളിലൂടെയുള്ള പ്രചോദനാത്മകമായ സംഗീത യാത്രകളിൽ പങ്കാളികളാകാം.<br><b><i><br>സാമൂഹിക ശാക്തീകരണം: </i></b><br>സംഗീതത്തിലൂടെയും കാരുണ്യപ്രവർത്തനങ്ങളിലൂടെയും സമൂഹത്തിൽ പോസിറ്റീവ് മാറ്റങ്ങൾ കൊണ്ടുവരാം.<br><b><i><br>വോളന്റിയർ സേവനം: </i></b><br>ഞങ്ങളുടെ പ്രവർത്തനങ്ങളെ സഹായിക്കാൻ വോളന്റിയർ ആയി മുന്നോട്ട് വരാം.<br><b><i><br>ഈ യാത്രയിൽ ഞങ്ങളോടൊപ്പം ചേരാൻ താല്പര്യമുണ്ടോ? </i></b><br>ഏതെങ്കിലും പ്രത്യേക മേഖലയിൽ (സംഗീതം, സംഘാടനം, അല്ലെങ്കിൽ യാത്ര) സഹായിക്കാൻ നിങ്ങൾക്ക് സാധിക്കുമോ?<br>ബിസിനസ്സ് ആവശ്യങ്ങൾക്കും സഹകരണങ്ങൾക്കും (Business Inquiries &amp; Collaborations):<br>നിങ്ങൾ ഒരു കലാകാരനാണോ? നിങ്ങളുടെ കവിതകളും സംഗീതവും ഞങ്ങളുടെ കമ്മ്യൂണിറ്റിയിലൂടെ പങ്കുവെക്കാൻ താല്പര്യമുണ്ടെങ്കിൽ, 'Collaboration' എന്ന് സബ്ജക്റ്റ് ലൈൻ എഴുതി ഞങ്ങൾക്ക് ഇമെയിൽ അയക്കുക<br>.This collective has been formed for those who wish to drive change through street music and motivational journeys. By becoming a part of our community, you can contribute to the following goals:<br><br>Street Music Ride: Take part in inspiring musical journeys through the streets.<br><br>Social Empowerment: Bring positive changes to society through music and charitable activities.<br><br>Volunteer Service: Step forward as a volunteer to support our initiatives and activities.<br><br>Interested in joining us on this journey?<br>Can you contribute to any specific area, such as music, management, or travel?<br><br>Business Inquiries &amp; Collaborations:<br>Are you an artist? If you would like to share your poetry and music through our community, please send us an email with the subject line 'Collaboration'.<br><br>हमारे समुदाय (Community) में आपका स्वागत है!<br><br>इस समूह का गठन उन लोगों के लिए किया गया है जो स्ट्रीट म्यूजिक (Street Music) और प्रेरक यात्राओं के माध्यम से समाज में बदलाव लाना चाहते हैं। हमारे समुदाय का हिस्सा बनकर, आप निम्नलिखित लक्ष्यों में शामिल हो सकते हैं:<br><br>स्ट्रीट म्यूजिक राइड (Street Music Ride): सड़कों पर होने वाली प्रेरक और संगीतमय यात्राओं का हिस्सा बनें।<br><br>सामाजिक सशक्तिकरण (Social Empowerment): संगीत और धर्मार्थ (charity) कार्यों के माध्यम से समाज में सकारात्मक बदलाव लाएं।<br><br>स्वयंसेवक सेवा (Volunteer Service): हमारी गतिविधियों और प्रयासों में मदद करने के लिए एक वॉलेंटियर के रूप में आगे आएं।<br><br>क्या आप इस यात्रा में हमारे साथ जुड़ने के लिए उत्सुक हैं?<br>क्या आप किसी विशेष क्षेत्र (जैसे संगीत, प्रबंधन या यात्रा) में हमारी मदद कर सकते हैं?<br><br>व्यावसायिक पूछताछ और सहयोग (Business Inquiries &amp; Collaborations):<br>क्या आप एक कलाकार हैं? यदि आप अपनी कविताओं और संगीत को हमारे समुदाय के माध्यम से साझा करना चाहते हैं, तो कृपया विषय (Subject Line) में 'Collaboration' लिखकर हमें ईमेल करें।<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://discord.gg/7agn9UxnZ\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Start Now</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vmNvNMSIS6",
          "_anchor": "header15-76",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".footer-col": {
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "display": "flex",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "flex-direction": "column"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "background": "@row",
              "padding": "4rem 3rem",
              "border-radius": "2rem",
              "margin": "0",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 0.5rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding": "2.25rem 1.25rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "4rem 3rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-btn": {
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "text-align": "center"
              }
            },
            ".social-row": {
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-wrap": "wrap"
            },
            ".soc-item": {
              "margin": "8px",
              "a": {
                "&:hover, &:focus": {
                  ".mbr-iconfont": {
                    "background-color": "@active"
                  }
                },
                ".mbr-iconfont": {
                  "width": "72px",
                  "height": "72px",
                  "display": "flex",
                  "align-items": "center",
                  "justify-content": "center",
                  "border-radius": "100%",
                  "font-size": "20px",
                  "background-color": "@iconBg",
                  "color": "@icon",
                  "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out"
                }
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".row": {
                "text-align": "center"
              },
              ".social-row": {
                "justify-content": "center"
              }
            },
            ".list": {
              "list-style": "none",
              "padding-left": "0",
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "0rem"
              },
              "color": "#502274"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#bbbbbb"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".list, .item-wrap": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "justify"
            },
            ".copyright": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "footer01",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"footer1\" group=\"Footers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" global once=\"footers\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Social\" name=\"showSocial\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#2e481a\" name=\"icon\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Active Color\" value=\"#e3d894\" condition=\"showSocial\" name=\"active\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"BG\" value=\"#f82d51\" name=\"iconBg\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" name=\"socialCount\" title=\"Social Count\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Copyright\" name=\"showCopyright\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Color</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Container\" name=\"row\" value=\"#faf9cf\">\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#faf9cf\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#474547\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row mbr-white\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3\">\n\t\t\t\t<h5 mbr-text class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>&nbsp;English</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•\tSlaves Of Death</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•\tCan’t You Hear The Screams</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•\tSilence Is Not Consent!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•\tTaboos And Prohibitions</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•\tZombie Song English Part 1</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•\tZombie Song English Part 2</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>• Enjoy Your Freedom</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>• Taboos and Prohibitions</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>• Tunnel Vision</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>• Bermuda Triangle</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>• Unheard Melodies of Death!</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3\">\n\t\t\t\t<h5 mbr-text class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>&nbsp;Malayalam</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•\tകുട്ടിപ്പാട്ട്!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•\tസോമ്പി സോങ്!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•മരണത്തിന്റെ നിഴലുകൾ!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•\tജീവനിൽ ഭയം!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•\tബർമുഡ ട്രയാങ്കിൾ!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•\tസ്വപ്നം പോലെ !</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•\t ടണൽ വിഷൻ!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•\tവിലക്കുകൾ!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•\tകുഞ്ഞേ പിറക്കരുതേ!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>•അരികിലായിരുന്നെങ്കിലും!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><br></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><br></li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3\">\n\t\t\t\t<h5 mbr-text class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>&nbsp;Malayalam</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>. സവർണ്ണസൂര്യൻ!&nbsp;</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>.&nbsp; ചരമഗീതം</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>. മൗനം സമ്മതമല്ല!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>. ലോകരക്ഷകൻ!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>. അടിമകൾ!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>. പൊറുക്കുക!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>• ഫ്രീഡം സോങ്!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>• സുഖമുള്ളൊരിടിമഴയായ്!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>• ഇരകൾ!</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>• നീയെടുക്കുന്നവാളുകൾ!</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3\">\n\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\"><b>Released</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\">•\t<a href=\"https://youtu.be/BQlpErgw4oo?si=3grDR24FSkYRH_a_\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">മാഡ്മാൻ Malayalam Part1</a>\n</li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\">•\t<a href=\"https://youtu.be/ERxVHwMeRFI?si=1EyEe_0XIdyq24uS\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">മാഡ്മാൻ Malayalam Part2</a>\n</li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/QBT0R1JYoos?si=B6W9aXOBVtAbbNhW\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">•\tമാഡ്മാൻ Malayalam Part3</a>\n</li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\">•<a href=\"https://youtu.be/2t3aub6ciGo?si=16yn8Ub82j4jK42X\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">\tMad Man_The God Puppet Master Part1</a>\n</li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\">•\t<a href=\"https://youtu.be/wN0o64K7cws?si=dM6B4g3vkY6LRhF_\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">Mad Man_The God Puppet Master Part2</a>\n</li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\">•\t<a href=\"https://youtu.be/H_jXoCIkxY0?si=CLnH995NU3PxPBUr\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">Mad Man_The God Puppet Master Part3</a>\n</li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\">•\t<a href=\"https://youtu.be/W-rJ2YpffmM?si=ZWi9JG-UiyR6IRT4\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">നിലവിളികൾ കേൾക്കുന്നില്ലേ</a>\n</li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\">•\t<a href=\"https://youtu.be/pqoE1oFndQc?si=cbZTXBXOPaEsaCP9\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">ജീവന്റെ വിലയുള്ള വാക്കുകൾ</a>\n</li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\">•<a href=\"https://youtu.be/K9FUwMcZdNY?si=28zF7Ynj8VEOZh-S\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">\tജീവന്റെവിലയുള്ളവാക്കുകൾ Shorts</a></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\">•\t<a href=\"https://push.fm/fl/ndcldren\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">അരാവല്ലിയുടെ കണ്ണുനീർ</a>\n</li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><br></li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 mt-5 footer-col\" mbr-if=\"showSocial || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t<div mbr-buttons mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL_yLGhCr5gTn4V5i6QJtc5T_5OQgrfSGk\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube Playlist</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://push.fm/fl/ndcldren\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Releases Playlist</a></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"social-row mt-2 display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"soc-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://mobiri.se/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-facebook\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://mobiri.se/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-twitter\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://mobiri.se/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://mobiri.se/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-logmein socicon\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showCopyright\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mb-0 mbr-fonts-style copyright align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".copyright\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t© Copyright 2026 www.iWizNet.in- All Rights Reserved\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
